The income is $0.16x$ dollars:

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\left(0.16\,\dfrac{\text{dollars}}{\text{kilogram}}\right)\left(x\,\text{kilograms}\right)
\\\\
&=0.16\cdot x\,\dfrac{\text{dollars}}{\cancel{\text{kilogram}}}\cdot\,\cancel{\text{kilograms}}
\\\\
&=0.16x\,\text{dollars}
\end{align}$

Similarly, the expenses are $c\cdot x$ dollars.
